WEBVTT

01:48.830 --> 01:54.140
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.289 --> 01:56.870
[Episode 15]

02:02.760 --> 02:04.160
Have you made a decision?

02:06.280 --> 02:07.480
Aren't you coming in?

02:13.560 --> 02:14.280
Honey,

02:14.910 --> 02:16.590
I suddenly have a business dinner tonight.

02:16.590 --> 02:18.590
Go to bed early. Don't wait up for me.

02:20.680 --> 02:22.010
How about Friday night?

02:22.450 --> 02:23.320
I'll take you out for dinner.

02:23.320 --> 02:24.440
Let's not go out.

02:24.460 --> 02:25.190
Just stay at home.

02:25.190 --> 02:26.590
I'll prepare something.

02:27.210 --> 02:28.360
But you have to promise me—

02:28.360 --> 02:29.760
you must come home early.

02:30.420 --> 02:33.300
[Happy 2nd Wedding Anniversary!]

03:10.240 --> 03:11.400
Did I wake you?

03:14.030 --> 03:14.680
No.

03:16.120 --> 03:16.800
Drink this.

03:17.710 --> 03:19.040
It'll help you sober up.

03:19.560 --> 03:20.450
Honey...

03:25.130 --> 03:26.930
I'm sorry I came home late again.

03:27.910 --> 03:28.680
It's okay.

03:29.120 --> 03:30.450
I know you've been busy.

03:41.120 --> 03:42.320
Sorry it's a day late.

03:45.030 --> 03:47.030
Happy second wedding anniversary.

04:02.630 --> 04:03.630
It's beautiful.

04:04.330 --> 04:05.210
I like it.

04:11.150 --> 04:12.910
I thought you'd forgotten.

04:13.630 --> 04:14.560
How could I?

04:31.160 --> 04:31.750
Miss,

04:32.270 --> 04:33.360
we've been going in circles.

04:33.360 --> 04:34.830
Where exactly are you going?

04:34.830 --> 04:36.000
This place is way too hard to find.

04:36.000 --> 04:37.390
Even the GPS can't locate it.

04:37.390 --> 04:38.360
We can't just

04:38.480 --> 04:39.680
keep driving around.

04:39.950 --> 04:40.720
Alright,

04:40.790 --> 04:42.000
I'll just get off here.

04:42.000 --> 04:42.860
Thank you, sir.

04:43.150 --> 04:43.710
Okay.

05:03.510 --> 05:04.800
Hello, excuse me,

05:04.800 --> 05:06.660
do you know where this factory is?

05:06.720 --> 05:08.250
I really don't know, sorry.

05:08.390 --> 05:09.310
Sorry.

05:16.340 --> 05:17.190
Hello, hello, excuse me.

05:17.190 --> 05:19.520
Do you know where this ceramic factory is?

05:19.720 --> 05:20.430
It's...

05:24.680 --> 05:26.410
Your destination is on your left.

05:26.410 --> 05:27.930
Navigation complete.

05:45.310 --> 05:45.830
Hello,

05:46.040 --> 05:46.970
my name is Hu Xiu.

05:47.720 --> 05:49.159
I'm an assistant architect

05:49.159 --> 05:50.360
from D Design Studio.

05:51.159 --> 05:52.070
Here's the thing:

05:52.070 --> 05:53.270
I recently saw your products

05:53.270 --> 05:55.440
at a ceramics exhibition
featured in a magazine.

05:55.440 --> 05:57.480
They fit perfectly with one of
our architectural project's requirements.

05:57.480 --> 05:59.120
So I wanted to come and learn more

05:59.120 --> 06:00.800
and see if we could establish further...

06:00.800 --> 06:01.830
I'm not the boss.

06:01.830 --> 06:03.290
I'm just a security guard.

06:05.040 --> 06:06.370
Then where's your boss?

06:06.940 --> 06:07.600
Over there.

06:17.920 --> 06:19.050
Is the content okay?

06:19.560 --> 06:20.190
Yeah.

06:20.940 --> 06:23.070
We have designated personnel
handling the legal matters.

06:23.070 --> 06:24.480
As long as the content is fine,

06:24.480 --> 06:25.680
you can rest assured.

06:25.830 --> 06:27.430
It's pretty tidy here.

06:27.610 --> 06:30.070
Feel free to contact me
if there are any issues in the future.

06:30.070 --> 06:32.130
Looking forward to working with you.

06:33.720 --> 06:34.650
This way, Mr. Ma.

06:37.870 --> 06:38.560
Take care.

06:41.680 --> 06:42.750
You must be tired from the meeting.

06:42.750 --> 06:44.070
I brought you some fruit.

06:44.070 --> 06:45.310
-Thank you, Xiaorou.
-Thank you, Xiaorou.

06:45.310 --> 06:46.530
Perfect timing. I need some sugar.

06:46.530 --> 06:47.720
I'm exhausted.

06:47.830 --> 06:49.950
Guangming has been running around
these past few days

06:49.950 --> 06:50.950
barely even having time for lunch,

06:50.950 --> 06:51.950
just to meet clients.

06:51.950 --> 06:53.390
What do you have to complain about?

06:53.390 --> 06:55.190
Well, it's a sweet complaint.

06:55.950 --> 06:56.750
But honestly,

06:56.750 --> 06:58.600
anywhere is better than Longyuan.

06:58.600 --> 06:59.000
Let me tell you,

06:59.000 --> 07:00.600
I just don't have Guangming's courage.

07:00.600 --> 07:01.560
Before he left,

07:01.560 --> 07:03.160
he really let Qu have it.

07:03.270 --> 07:05.470
That was so awesome, right, Guangming?

07:05.830 --> 07:06.960
Let's go have fruit.

07:07.060 --> 07:09.060
What does he mean by "let Qu have it"?

07:10.240 --> 07:11.560
You left Longyuan?

07:12.800 --> 07:13.920
G-Go have fruit.

07:14.180 --> 07:14.600
Okay.

07:15.800 --> 07:16.480
Honey,

07:16.800 --> 07:18.200
come with me for a moment.

07:18.510 --> 07:19.990
What's going on?

07:21.560 --> 07:22.630
Have a seat, honey.

07:31.800 --> 07:33.800
Mr. Qu found out about Zhan Jie and me

07:34.360 --> 07:35.890
starting our own business.

07:36.360 --> 07:38.240
I'm in the middle of handing things over

07:38.240 --> 07:40.100
and will officially resign soon.

07:40.360 --> 07:41.830
But honey, don't worry.

07:42.159 --> 07:43.750
Tao registered Solara,

07:44.120 --> 07:46.120
and I've checked
Longyuan's internal policies.

07:46.120 --> 07:47.980
Mr. Qu can't hold us accountable.

07:52.000 --> 07:52.800
Guangming,

07:53.240 --> 07:54.040
I've always felt

07:54.040 --> 07:55.950
that you were working too hard before.

07:55.950 --> 07:56.630
I've always supported

07:56.630 --> 07:58.120
you leaving Longyuan.

07:58.270 --> 07:59.830
But why is your first reaction always

07:59.830 --> 08:02.690
to hide things from me
whenever something happens?

08:03.430 --> 08:04.070
Is there anything

08:04.070 --> 08:05.950
that we, as husband and wife, can't...

08:05.950 --> 08:07.150
can't face together?

08:07.430 --> 08:08.510
It's just that I thought

08:08.510 --> 08:10.000
the procedures weren't complete

08:10.000 --> 08:11.430
and the company wasn't stable yet,

08:11.430 --> 08:12.830
so I didn't dare tell you.

08:14.480 --> 08:16.680
Honey, I know this would make you worry.

08:17.630 --> 08:18.390
I was wrong.

08:19.920 --> 08:20.630
I'm sorry.

08:22.040 --> 08:22.950
I promise you

08:24.000 --> 08:25.680
from now on, I'll tell you about
any decision I make.

08:25.680 --> 08:26.870
No more hiding things,

08:26.870 --> 08:27.560
okay?

08:30.390 --> 08:31.920
Don't be mad anymore, okay?

08:35.240 --> 08:36.570
I have good news for you.

08:43.320 --> 08:45.320
Remember I mentioned

08:45.790 --> 08:46.720
that a major company

08:46.720 --> 08:49.120
was interested in taking over our project?

08:49.790 --> 08:50.840
Five minutes ago,

08:51.560 --> 08:52.410
we just signed

08:52.810 --> 08:53.730
the contract.

08:55.150 --> 08:57.630
Our company will definitely make it.

08:58.120 --> 08:59.320
The big house we want,

08:59.960 --> 09:01.270
a big coffee shop,

09:02.030 --> 09:02.870
and a big dog—

09:03.630 --> 09:04.790
we'll have them all.

09:05.790 --> 09:08.640
Even if you don't have to
run between two companies,

09:08.640 --> 09:10.900
you'll still be busy like a spinning top.

09:11.880 --> 09:12.740
Busy like what?

09:13.480 --> 09:14.510
A spinning top.

09:17.960 --> 09:18.870
A spinning top.

09:21.510 --> 09:22.570
A big spinning top.

09:25.360 --> 09:27.090
I'm just a medium spinning top.

09:28.630 --> 09:29.510
-They're spinning!
-Yeah!

09:29.510 --> 09:31.030
I won't be a spinning top.

09:31.870 --> 09:33.200
Don't be mad anymore.

09:34.080 --> 09:35.480
What are these two doing?

09:35.720 --> 09:36.630
They're so sweet!

09:36.630 --> 09:37.440
So sweet!

09:39.670 --> 09:40.730
They're watching.

10:06.550 --> 10:07.240
Hu Xiu?

10:20.960 --> 10:21.630
Miss,

10:21.770 --> 10:22.800
do you work here?

10:24.030 --> 10:25.560
This place is quite remote.

10:26.070 --> 10:27.120
After my last drop-off,

10:27.120 --> 10:29.030
I thought I'd have to drive back
with no customer,

10:29.030 --> 10:31.230
but I didn't expect to run into you here.

10:31.390 --> 10:32.960
What a coincidence, sir.

10:33.360 --> 10:34.870
If I hadn't run into you driving out here,

10:34.870 --> 10:36.360
I wouldn't have been able to get back.

10:36.360 --> 10:38.420
I've been trying to get a cab for ages.

10:44.870 --> 10:45.550
Hello, Sun.

10:45.670 --> 10:46.360
Hu Xiu,

10:46.510 --> 10:48.240
Lyman's celebration banquet
is about to start.

10:48.240 --> 10:49.200
When will you arrive?

10:49.200 --> 10:50.480
I'm already on my way.

10:50.600 --> 10:51.800
Should be there soon.

10:52.000 --> 10:52.550
Sir,

10:52.550 --> 10:55.000
could you please drive a bit faster?
Thanks.

10:55.000 --> 10:56.150
Sure, no problem.

10:56.390 --> 10:57.450
I'll be there soon.

11:25.720 --> 11:26.270
Mr. Xiao.

11:27.240 --> 11:29.120
Congratulations on
winning the competition.

11:29.120 --> 11:30.510
You're truly a young talent

11:30.510 --> 11:31.440
with unlimited potential.

11:31.440 --> 11:32.030
Mr. Xiao.

11:32.030 --> 11:32.390
You flatter me.

11:32.390 --> 11:33.320
Our company has a project,

11:33.320 --> 11:34.670
and we'd like to invite you
to be our consultant.

11:34.670 --> 11:36.130
You must accept our offer.

11:36.320 --> 11:36.870
Mr. Xiao,

11:37.080 --> 11:38.270
so successful at a young age.

11:38.270 --> 11:38.930
I wonder...

11:39.360 --> 11:40.360
are you married?

11:41.000 --> 11:41.600
No.

11:42.200 --> 11:43.400
Starting a family and building a career

11:43.400 --> 11:44.920
go hand in hand,

11:45.120 --> 11:45.750
am I right?

11:55.710 --> 11:56.350
Thank you.

11:58.340 --> 11:59.450
Mr. Song, come on.

12:03.660 --> 12:04.990
Could you introduce us?

12:05.170 --> 12:05.830
No problem.

12:05.830 --> 12:06.470
Xiao!

12:06.790 --> 12:08.030
Mr. Xie, Mr. Li.

12:10.000 --> 12:10.600
Mr. Xiao,

12:11.450 --> 12:12.980
this is my daughter, An'an.

12:14.360 --> 12:15.290
Nice to meet you.

12:18.150 --> 12:18.680
Let's go.

12:30.390 --> 12:31.150
Ms. Hu?

12:32.320 --> 12:33.650
This feels like déjà vu.

12:33.670 --> 12:34.300
What?

12:34.320 --> 12:36.980
Here to play
the beauty rescuing the hero again?

12:38.510 --> 12:40.310
Mr. Pei, you're actually right.

12:44.600 --> 12:45.270
Hu Xiu.

12:48.550 --> 12:49.150
Ms. Zhou.

12:51.200 --> 12:52.030
Where have you been?

12:52.030 --> 12:52.840
This is such an important event,

12:52.840 --> 12:53.840
and you're late.

12:53.970 --> 12:55.900
I was busy inspecting...

12:57.510 --> 12:58.720
Here's the dress prepared for you.

12:58.720 --> 12:59.720
Put it on quickly.

12:59.800 --> 13:00.920
Tonight's banquet

13:00.960 --> 13:02.550
has all the big names in the industry.

13:02.550 --> 13:04.150
It's a big day for our studio.

13:04.440 --> 13:05.300
Look your best.

13:08.270 --> 13:09.080
Okay.

13:22.240 --> 13:24.000
So you graduated from
Cornell University, Mr. Xiao.

13:24.000 --> 13:24.900
That's impressive.

13:24.900 --> 13:26.810
I used to visit friends there
all the time.

13:26.810 --> 13:28.910
Maybe we even saw each other back then.

13:28.910 --> 13:29.670
Maybe.

13:30.390 --> 13:31.550
What a coincidence, Mr. Xiao.

13:31.550 --> 13:33.150
I also graduated from Cornell.

13:33.150 --> 13:34.720
Could I add you on WeChat?

13:34.930 --> 13:35.480
I'm sorry.

13:35.480 --> 13:37.410
My phone is charging in the lounge.

13:41.670 --> 13:43.950
This is a 2013 Dom Pérignon.

13:44.940 --> 13:45.870
It's quite good.

13:46.160 --> 13:46.920
Try it.

13:47.040 --> 13:47.710
Cheers.

14:40.440 --> 14:41.320
Excuse me,

14:41.430 --> 14:43.050
Mr. Xiao will be giving a speech later.

14:43.050 --> 14:44.650
Let me drink this one for him.

14:45.550 --> 14:46.150
Mr. Xiao,

14:46.630 --> 14:47.840
who is she?

14:49.170 --> 14:50.400
I'm Mr. Xiao's employee,

14:50.400 --> 14:50.910
Hu Xiu,

14:50.910 --> 14:52.840
assistant architect at Dynamism.

14:55.390 --> 14:57.720
Mr. Xiao needs to go prepare first.

14:57.740 --> 14:59.460
Please wait a moment.

14:59.760 --> 15:01.450
I believe Mr. Xiao's speech

15:01.480 --> 15:03.740
will definitely not disappoint you all.

15:10.300 --> 15:10.900
Excuse us.

15:20.150 --> 15:21.080
Only Hu Xiu could

15:21.080 --> 15:22.340
have gotten you out of there.

15:22.340 --> 15:23.030
Otherwise, who knows

15:23.030 --> 15:24.910
how long you'd still be
stuck talking to them?

15:24.910 --> 15:25.790
I have to say,

15:26.550 --> 15:28.210
in that dress, you and Mr. Xiao

15:28.340 --> 15:29.870
look pretty well-matched.

15:33.270 --> 15:34.030
Last time you said

15:34.030 --> 15:35.890
you wanted to find a supplier
of 3D printing materials.

15:35.890 --> 15:36.700
I found one.

15:43.000 --> 15:43.480
Do you remember

15:43.480 --> 15:44.550
the ceramic art factory

15:44.550 --> 15:46.360
I mentioned before?

15:46.790 --> 15:47.840
I looked into it.

15:47.960 --> 15:49.480
Their technology is not a problem,

15:49.480 --> 15:50.750
but they do need to overcome
the production capacity issue

15:50.750 --> 15:52.030
we discussed earlier.

15:52.610 --> 15:54.170
However, as long as we pay in full upfront

15:54.170 --> 15:55.660
and don't let them bear the cost pressure,

15:55.660 --> 15:57.120
they'll fully cooperate.

15:57.760 --> 16:00.220
So this is
what you've been busy with lately?

16:02.390 --> 16:04.480
If we can't pay in full upfront,

16:04.480 --> 16:06.410
I can communicate with them again.

16:07.150 --> 16:08.410
Ladies and gentlemen,

16:09.140 --> 16:09.940
good evening.

16:09.990 --> 16:11.510
First, on behalf of Lyman,

16:12.000 --> 16:13.750
I'd like to welcome and thank

16:14.090 --> 16:15.570
all of you for being here.

16:14.620 --> 16:19.450
[Lyman Group · Future Living ·
Celebration Banquet]

16:19.630 --> 16:22.270
The design competition
for our company's resort community

16:22.270 --> 16:23.790
has attracted enormous attention.

16:23.790 --> 16:24.550
Mr. Xiao Zhiyu

16:24.550 --> 16:26.480
from Dynamism

16:26.830 --> 16:29.000
has won over the judges

16:29.550 --> 16:30.960
with his bold and brilliant proposal

16:30.960 --> 16:33.760
and has become the chief designer
of this project.

16:34.200 --> 16:35.030
I believe

16:35.240 --> 16:37.300
that once this project is completed,

16:37.470 --> 16:40.120
it will surely become

16:40.150 --> 16:43.210
another shining landmark
in the architectural field!

16:46.120 --> 16:46.720
Furthermore,

16:46.720 --> 16:48.200
I'd like to sincerely thank

16:48.200 --> 16:50.630
all other companies
that participated in the competition.

16:50.630 --> 16:52.990
Although we didn't get to
cooperate this time,

16:52.990 --> 16:55.170
there will be opportunities in the future.

16:55.170 --> 16:56.530
We sincerely hope

16:56.560 --> 16:59.080
to cooperate and achieve mutual success
with all of you.

16:59.080 --> 17:00.080
Now, let's invite

17:00.200 --> 17:02.680
Mr. Xiao Zhiyu, the chief designer

17:03.030 --> 17:04.510
of the Lyman Resort Community,

17:04.510 --> 17:05.480
to the stage.

17:11.960 --> 17:12.880
It is an honor

17:12.880 --> 17:13.550
to stand here

17:13.550 --> 17:15.160
on behalf of Dynamism.

17:15.640 --> 17:17.480
Our studio will do our utmost

17:17.720 --> 17:19.440
to live up to everyone's trust,

17:19.440 --> 17:21.920
making this project a classic masterpiece.

17:24.250 --> 17:26.480
Taking advantage of
this important occasion,

17:26.480 --> 17:27.880
I'd also like to announce

17:27.960 --> 17:30.220
a major decision on behalf of our studio.

17:35.880 --> 17:36.550
Dynamism

17:36.550 --> 17:38.350
has already signed

17:38.350 --> 17:40.590
a project cooperation letter of intent
with Zhuling Group.

17:40.590 --> 17:42.510
We'll officially begin cooperation
after the New Year

17:42.510 --> 17:45.570
to jointly complete the construction
of this project.

17:55.240 --> 17:57.180
That factory director's former chauffeur

17:57.180 --> 17:59.030
became a building materials supplier.

17:59.030 --> 18:00.440
The powerful backer he latched onto

18:00.440 --> 18:01.960
is Zhuling Group.

18:14.390 --> 18:15.020
Hu Xiu?

18:17.270 --> 18:17.960
Ms. Zhou.

18:18.310 --> 18:20.070
So you just came from

18:20.070 --> 18:21.000
the supplier.

18:21.000 --> 18:22.130
You've worked hard.

18:22.640 --> 18:23.340
Not hard at all,

18:23.340 --> 18:24.340
just doing my job.

18:25.200 --> 18:26.960
I just didn't expect

18:27.280 --> 18:29.740
that Mr. Xiao had already made
the decision.

18:29.990 --> 18:31.340
The cooperation with Zhuling

18:31.340 --> 18:33.990
was only finalized
right before today's banquet.

18:33.990 --> 18:35.470
I was also surprised

18:35.920 --> 18:37.580
when Mr. Xiao told me about it.

18:38.160 --> 18:39.160
I figured as much—

18:39.320 --> 18:40.680
if we're working with Zhuling,

18:40.680 --> 18:42.350
they would definitely use
their supplier resources

18:42.350 --> 18:43.550
as a bargaining chip.

18:43.720 --> 18:45.250
But what I didn't expect was

18:45.310 --> 18:47.480
that Mr. Pei would make
such excessive demands.

18:47.480 --> 18:49.680
He's after the entire Lyman's project.

18:50.160 --> 18:51.600
What I least expected was

18:51.960 --> 18:54.000
that Mr. Xiao would actually accept it.

18:54.000 --> 18:54.790
However,

18:55.310 --> 18:57.170
looking at it from another angle,

18:57.310 --> 18:59.720
the two companies
working together peacefully

18:59.720 --> 19:01.050
might not be a bad thing.

19:01.240 --> 19:02.070
Besides,

19:02.470 --> 19:04.830
Mr. Xie and Mr. Pei
have a good relationship,

19:04.830 --> 19:07.760
which will help the project
progress more smoothly.

19:08.830 --> 19:09.680
I understand.

19:10.380 --> 19:11.520
Go grab something to eat.

19:11.520 --> 19:12.320
See you later.

19:31.350 --> 19:32.020
Thank you.

19:33.910 --> 19:36.770
You're here to see Mr. Xiao
about something urgent?

19:37.550 --> 19:39.680
Just some minor matters at the studio.

19:40.790 --> 19:42.850
It was about the supplier, wasn't it?

19:44.960 --> 19:45.720
I know

19:45.920 --> 19:48.120
you've been looking for new suppliers.

19:48.310 --> 19:49.200
But clearly,

19:49.310 --> 19:50.790
no matter how hard you look,

19:50.790 --> 19:53.160
you won't find anyone more suitable
than Zhuling.

19:53.160 --> 19:54.920
You're quite confident, Mr. Pei.

19:54.920 --> 19:55.880
Do you really think

19:55.880 --> 19:59.010
you can control
the entire supply chain in the industry?

19:59.310 --> 20:00.110
You're wrong.

20:00.150 --> 20:01.150
We don't need to.

20:01.820 --> 20:04.070
We can't monopolize
the entire industry's supply.

20:04.070 --> 20:05.030
What we can do

20:05.400 --> 20:06.530
is keep the best part

20:06.530 --> 20:07.770
for ourselves,

20:08.030 --> 20:09.090
and that's enough.

20:10.110 --> 20:11.440
And your boss, Mr. Xiao,

20:11.880 --> 20:14.810
he's indeed a clear-headed,
decisive businessman.

20:14.960 --> 20:16.490
Especially in this matter,

20:17.000 --> 20:19.130
he knows when to bend and when to stand.

20:19.480 --> 20:20.740
Your company is the one

20:20.950 --> 20:22.010
seeking this work.

20:22.350 --> 20:24.120
If we're talking about
who truly knows how to "bend,"

20:24.120 --> 20:25.850
I'd say you're the master at it.

20:26.400 --> 20:29.070
It was your boss who willingly chose to
work with me.

20:29.070 --> 20:29.930
The word "bend"

20:30.270 --> 20:31.670
doesn't even apply here.

20:32.150 --> 20:33.750
Using supplier resources

20:34.070 --> 20:36.070
in exchange for project cooperation—

20:36.070 --> 20:39.200
the cooperation opportunity
you schemed so hard to get—

20:39.440 --> 20:41.570
and you still say it wasn't "bending"?

20:48.510 --> 20:49.440
Alright, Ms. Hu,

20:49.680 --> 20:51.140
let's not debate anymore.

20:51.880 --> 20:53.740
May I have the honor of this dance?

20:56.680 --> 20:58.480
We're about to become partners.

20:59.010 --> 21:01.610
You wouldn't deny me this courtesy,
would you?

21:20.880 --> 21:21.880
In that case,

21:22.270 --> 21:23.960
I shall respectfully comply.

21:48.580 --> 21:49.210
I'm fine.

21:50.280 --> 21:52.480
Is this your first time dancing, Ms. Hu?

21:53.610 --> 21:54.520
Of course not.

21:55.400 --> 21:57.070
You don't seem very practiced.

21:57.070 --> 21:59.000
I can only work with what I'm given.

21:59.690 --> 22:01.540
Well then, I'd better perform well

22:01.540 --> 22:03.060
so as not to hold you back.

22:17.550 --> 22:19.880
Excuse me, everyone. Sorry to interrupt.

22:22.200 --> 22:23.640
In terms of construction,

22:23.640 --> 22:25.830
Zhuling has always been
an industry leader.

22:25.830 --> 22:27.110
Our studio is also very honored

22:27.110 --> 22:28.570
to collaborate with them.

22:28.830 --> 22:30.440
Taking advantage of this occasion today,

22:30.440 --> 22:31.840
I'd like to invite Mr. Pei

22:32.630 --> 22:34.690
to give a speech on behalf of Zhuling.

22:46.030 --> 22:47.640
Why do you still look so glum?

22:48.880 --> 22:49.680
I'm not.

22:50.720 --> 22:51.320
Oh, right,

22:51.400 --> 22:52.030
Ms. Zhou,

22:52.240 --> 22:54.400
thank you for preparing this dress for me.

22:54.400 --> 22:57.200
Otherwise, I would've
embarrassed myself badly again today.

22:57.200 --> 22:58.510
I didn't prepare it.

22:58.720 --> 23:00.650
Mr. Xiao asked me to bring it to you.

23:29.550 --> 23:31.010
Why are you out here alone?

23:33.590 --> 23:35.000
There are too many people inside.

23:35.000 --> 23:35.930
It's too stuffy.

24:02.750 --> 24:04.480
When did you make the decision?

24:08.640 --> 24:09.240
Mr. Xie,

24:09.750 --> 24:11.410
do you have time to meet today?

24:12.560 --> 24:14.620
I'd like to introduce someone to you.

24:15.720 --> 24:16.270
Sure.

24:16.750 --> 24:18.210
Come to my office tonight.

24:18.790 --> 24:19.400
Okay.

24:21.000 --> 24:21.960
I never expected

24:22.590 --> 24:23.510
that you two

24:23.960 --> 24:25.400
had such a connection.

24:26.640 --> 24:28.160
Zhiyu has been independent since childhood

24:28.160 --> 24:29.720
and never wanted support from the family,

24:29.720 --> 24:30.720
so we didn't

24:30.960 --> 24:31.960
make it public.

24:33.270 --> 24:34.510
You could have relied on

24:34.510 --> 24:36.480
a major corporation like Zhuling,

24:36.880 --> 24:39.340
yet you insisted on
striking out on your own.

24:39.480 --> 24:40.200
Mr. Xiao,

24:40.880 --> 24:42.680
you never cease to amaze me.

24:43.030 --> 24:43.640
Mr. Xie,

24:44.040 --> 24:45.640
my studio and Zhuling

24:45.640 --> 24:47.970
have no financial or equity connections.

24:48.000 --> 24:49.000
My relationship with the Pei family

24:49.000 --> 24:51.080
won't affect
the project's progress either.

24:51.080 --> 24:52.880
You can hire a supervision agency

24:52.880 --> 24:54.240
to oversee the construction process

24:54.240 --> 24:57.030
and ensure our cooperation is
fair and transparent.

24:57.030 --> 24:57.880
Uncle Xie,

24:58.310 --> 24:59.350
Zhuling

24:59.400 --> 25:01.310
attaches great importance to
Lyman's project this time.

25:01.310 --> 25:02.210
Please rest assured—

25:02.210 --> 25:03.800
we will commit our best resources

25:03.800 --> 25:05.260
to complete this project.

25:07.650 --> 25:09.580
In the company, only you know about

25:09.830 --> 25:11.830
my relationship with the Pei family.

25:11.830 --> 25:12.590
You've been

25:13.350 --> 25:15.350
working so hard to find suppliers
these past few days

25:15.350 --> 25:17.230
because you didn't want to see me
bow to Zhuling,

25:17.230 --> 25:17.800
right?

25:24.200 --> 25:25.000
I'm sorry

25:25.600 --> 25:28.060
I didn't tell you about
my decision earlier.

25:31.310 --> 25:32.510
No need to apologize.

25:32.830 --> 25:33.960
I just didn't expect

25:34.640 --> 25:37.370
that you would actually
cooperate with Zhuling.

25:39.990 --> 25:41.520
What did Pei Zhen say to you?

25:43.200 --> 25:43.960
He said

25:44.420 --> 25:46.550
you know when to bend and when to stand.

25:51.200 --> 25:51.850
Then...

25:53.880 --> 25:54.880
what do you think?

26:03.960 --> 26:04.720
I think...

26:09.310 --> 26:11.440
I think since you've made this choice,

26:11.920 --> 26:13.780
it must be absolutely necessary,

26:14.240 --> 26:15.500
not just a last resort.

26:16.460 --> 26:21.010
♪ Close your eyes for me ♪

26:22.540 --> 26:24.710
♪ Don't rush to wake up ♪

26:25.180 --> 26:28.400
♪ Before the night ends ♪

26:27.830 --> 26:29.030
Why are you smiling?

26:31.280 --> 26:36.600
♪ Will you stay with me? ♪

26:31.790 --> 26:32.680
I'm smiling...

26:34.160 --> 26:36.490
because you're not angry anymore, right?

26:37.520 --> 26:39.520
♪ I won't search for ♪

26:40.320 --> 26:43.130
♪ The reason we met ♪

26:44.770 --> 26:50.300
♪ The city gradually turns pale
outside the window ♪

26:46.720 --> 26:48.120
I've accepted your gift,

26:48.350 --> 26:49.480
so how can I stay mad?

26:51.790 --> 26:53.910
♪ The stars twinkle ♪

26:53.550 --> 26:54.480
You look pretty.

26:54.900 --> 26:58.910
♪ I've quieted down ♪

27:00.640 --> 27:03.840
♪ What kind of story will you like? ♪

27:03.960 --> 27:05.620
♪ Would you join me? ♪

27:05.650 --> 27:09.410
♪ To make a long, romantic dream ♪

27:10.130 --> 27:12.700
♪ Just you and me ♪

27:15.420 --> 27:17.600
♪ Briefly, beyond the clamor ♪

27:17.630 --> 27:19.610
♪ Carefully drawing close to you ♪

27:19.640 --> 27:23.080
♪ Clinging to that trace of unknown joy ♪

27:25.390 --> 27:27.710
♪ Under moonlight ♪

27:30.070 --> 27:32.640
♪ Briefly, beyond the clamor ♪

27:32.680 --> 27:34.580
♪ Getting closer to you secretly ♪

27:34.600 --> 27:38.450
♪ Clinging to that trace of unknown joy ♪

27:38.840 --> 27:42.850
♪ Oh, special night ♪

27:46.080 --> 27:50.350
♪ We will meet tomorrow ♪

27:51.710 --> 27:53.320
♪ I know ♪

27:52.070 --> 27:52.720
Zhiyu,

27:53.160 --> 27:54.240
I know everything now.

27:53.340 --> 27:57.880
♪ Oh, special night ♪

27:54.750 --> 27:56.480
I'm very happy you agreed

27:56.720 --> 27:58.250
to cooperate with Zhuling.

27:58.350 --> 27:59.960
Uncle Pei was just saying

28:00.310 --> 28:01.590
we're a family,

28:00.750 --> 28:05.300
♪ Oh, special night ♪

28:01.830 --> 28:03.490
and it's wonderful when we can

28:03.680 --> 28:05.680
work together toward the same goal.

28:11.480 --> 28:13.160
Everyone, come get your gift boxes
before leaving work!

28:13.160 --> 28:14.620
There's one for everyone!

28:18.400 --> 28:19.830
We get two gift boxes this year?

28:19.830 --> 28:20.560
What is this?

28:20.880 --> 28:22.240
We just landed a big project,

28:22.240 --> 28:24.510
so Ms. Zhou and Mr. Xiao
must be feeling generous.

28:24.510 --> 28:25.370
-Right.
-Yeah.

28:25.440 --> 28:26.750
Let me open it and take a look.

28:26.750 --> 28:27.550
All done.

28:28.160 --> 28:29.220
Time for vacation!

28:30.130 --> 28:31.610
I'm almost done too.

28:31.630 --> 28:33.880
Once I finish organizing the materials
for our post–New Year work

28:33.880 --> 28:35.790
with Zhuling, I'll email them to you.

28:35.790 --> 28:36.270
Okay.

28:36.440 --> 28:37.350
Let me try to snag a train ticket first.

28:37.350 --> 28:38.480
I'll check it later.

28:47.720 --> 28:48.310
Mr. Xiao,

28:48.600 --> 28:50.930
how are you planning to
spend the New Year?

28:52.640 --> 28:54.240
Just like any other day.

28:55.440 --> 28:56.300
What about you?

28:57.480 --> 28:59.680
My parents used to come to the lane
to celebrate the New Year with me.

28:59.680 --> 29:01.610
It's kind of our family tradition.

29:01.640 --> 29:03.880
We feel the old house
has a more festive atmosphere.

29:03.880 --> 29:05.310
It's close to downtown after all,

29:05.310 --> 29:06.790
so it's very convenient
to see the lanterns.

29:06.790 --> 29:08.390
Just a ten-minute walk or so.

29:08.400 --> 29:09.070
Perfect.

29:09.440 --> 29:10.880
I won't be staying in the lane
during the New Year.

29:10.880 --> 29:12.540
Feel free to use it as you like.

29:16.460 --> 29:19.150
I was going to ask
if you'd like to join us.

29:23.310 --> 29:24.170
Happy New Year.

29:24.480 --> 29:26.210
Happy New Year. Happy New Year.

29:28.350 --> 29:29.310
Li, happy New Year!

29:29.310 --> 29:30.310
Happy New Year. Happy New Year.

29:30.310 --> 29:31.400
Here, eight-treasure rice pudding.

29:31.400 --> 29:32.030
Great.

29:32.030 --> 29:34.070
I get to taste
your eight-treasure rice pudding again!

29:34.070 --> 29:34.830
Thank you, thank you.

29:34.830 --> 29:35.830
You're welcome.

29:35.830 --> 29:36.200
Alright, alright.

29:36.200 --> 29:37.060
Happy New Year.

29:37.640 --> 29:38.400
Happy New Year. Happy New Year.

29:38.400 --> 29:39.400
Thank you.

29:40.720 --> 29:41.350
Hu!

29:41.480 --> 29:42.350
Happy New Year. Happy New Year!

29:42.350 --> 29:44.080
Happy New Year. Happy New Year.

29:44.640 --> 29:45.640
Be careful!

29:47.640 --> 29:49.030
Granny, happy New Year.

29:49.350 --> 29:50.880
You're in such good health.

29:51.310 --> 29:53.590
You came back to spend
the New Year with Xiu?

29:53.590 --> 29:54.350
Yes, yes.

29:54.720 --> 29:55.320
Oh, right,

29:55.440 --> 29:57.240
this is eight-treasure rice pudding
we made ourselves.

29:57.240 --> 29:58.170
Please try some.

29:58.350 --> 29:59.310
Okay, okay.

29:59.310 --> 30:00.370
I'll be right back.

30:01.510 --> 30:02.680
Her favorite.

30:05.720 --> 30:06.580
Happy New Year.

30:06.960 --> 30:08.510
The lanterns look really nice.

30:08.510 --> 30:09.030
Yeah.

30:09.510 --> 30:10.720
They're more festive.

30:10.720 --> 30:11.440
Mr. Hu?

30:11.750 --> 30:12.480
Happy New Year!

30:12.480 --> 30:13.480
Happy New Year.

30:14.270 --> 30:14.830
Dad,

30:15.030 --> 30:16.590
it's been a while since you greeted anyone
like that, right?

30:16.590 --> 30:17.030
Yes.

30:17.350 --> 30:19.920
After walking around, I can see
things really have changed a lot.

30:19.920 --> 30:20.640
Help me check

30:20.640 --> 30:22.510
if these are straight on both sides.

30:22.510 --> 30:23.570
The one on the right

30:23.790 --> 30:24.310
needs to move a bit to the left...

30:24.310 --> 30:24.920
Xiu!

30:25.350 --> 30:26.440
Xiaorou is video calling you

30:26.440 --> 30:28.270
to wish our family a happy New Year.

30:28.270 --> 30:29.600
Okay, I'm going inside.

30:30.030 --> 30:30.920
Egg dumplings!

30:31.680 --> 30:34.010
-Granny made them.
-They are my favorite!

30:35.400 --> 30:36.240
Zhao!

30:36.750 --> 30:38.070
Happy New Year!

30:38.510 --> 30:40.440
-Happy New Year.
-Happy New Year.

30:40.790 --> 30:42.270
That new cardigan
looks really nice on you.

30:42.270 --> 30:44.270
We bought it together last time
we went shopping, right?

30:44.270 --> 30:45.110
That's the one.

30:45.110 --> 30:45.440
It looks really nice.

30:45.440 --> 30:46.240
Isn't it good?

30:47.550 --> 30:48.680
Uncle Hu, Auntie Bai,

30:48.680 --> 30:49.750
happy New Year.

30:49.750 --> 30:51.590
Wishing you good health.

30:51.590 --> 30:53.830
Thank you, Xiaorou.
Happy New Year to you too!

30:53.830 --> 30:55.590
We're preparing the New Year's Eve dinner.

30:55.590 --> 30:58.160
Are you at your own place
or at your parents'?

30:58.160 --> 31:00.110
Guangming and I are at my parents' place.

31:00.110 --> 31:00.830
I wish you

31:00.830 --> 31:01.750
success in your career

31:01.750 --> 31:04.070
and that you and Zhao achieve
financial freedom soon,

31:04.070 --> 31:05.920
so I can share in your good fortune.

31:05.920 --> 31:07.000
Thanks for the good wishes.

31:07.000 --> 31:07.640
Xiaorou,

31:07.960 --> 31:08.590
well,

31:08.590 --> 31:10.400
I wish you young lovebirds

31:10.400 --> 31:11.350
a smooth new year

31:12.030 --> 31:13.690
and hope you have a child soon.

31:14.590 --> 31:15.400
Thank you, Uncle.

31:15.400 --> 31:16.510
Thank you, Uncle.

31:16.680 --> 31:17.680
Um, Xiaorou,

31:17.830 --> 31:20.290
let me wish your parents
a happy New Year too.

31:20.750 --> 31:22.160
Sure, I'll go get them.

31:22.160 --> 31:23.290
You elders can chat.

31:23.590 --> 31:25.160
I'll go make some tangyuan.

31:25.830 --> 31:27.920
Xiu, make one with sugar filling.

31:27.920 --> 31:28.160
Alright.

31:28.160 --> 31:28.880
For good fortune.

31:28.880 --> 31:29.720
Sure thing.

31:33.270 --> 31:34.160
Hello, hello.

31:47.890 --> 31:49.890
Did you ask Zhiyu to come for dinner?

31:50.680 --> 31:52.880
This year, our whole family is in China.

31:53.510 --> 31:55.400
We should have
a family reunion dinner together.

31:55.400 --> 31:56.270
I asked him.

31:56.720 --> 31:57.980
I've been busy cooking

31:58.000 --> 32:00.260
and haven't had time to check WeChat yet.

32:02.200 --> 32:03.440
That must be Zhiyu.

32:11.310 --> 32:12.270
Zhiyu?

32:13.030 --> 32:13.680
Uncle Xu,

32:14.030 --> 32:14.890
happy New Year.

32:15.680 --> 32:17.400
You're Ms. Xiao Wanyue, right?

32:17.400 --> 32:18.480
This is for you.

32:24.680 --> 32:25.200
Mom,

32:25.590 --> 32:26.880
I sent you some gifts,

32:27.060 --> 32:28.720
and I won't be joining you for dinner.

32:28.720 --> 32:30.310
Wishing you a happy Spring Festival

32:30.310 --> 32:31.240
and good health.

32:35.310 --> 32:36.480
Look at you,

32:36.500 --> 32:38.160
you really didn't need to buy all these.

32:38.160 --> 32:39.560
I still haven't finished

32:40.240 --> 32:41.070
the liquor you gave me

32:41.070 --> 32:42.510
last New Year.

32:44.830 --> 32:45.720
I didn't expect

32:46.030 --> 32:47.200
you'd come.

32:47.590 --> 32:50.160
I heard earlier that your mother was
coming back to Shanghai this year,

32:50.160 --> 32:51.620
and I thought you would...

32:53.110 --> 32:53.610
By the way,

32:53.610 --> 32:55.000
you landed a big project,

32:55.000 --> 32:57.400
and I haven't
properly congratulated you yet.

32:57.400 --> 32:58.110
Wait a moment.

32:58.110 --> 32:59.240
I'll prepare some food,

32:59.240 --> 33:00.030
and we can have a drink.

33:00.030 --> 33:00.640
Uncle Xu.

33:01.680 --> 33:02.880
I'm just stopping by.

33:02.920 --> 33:04.720
Please don't trouble yourself.

33:06.550 --> 33:08.590
I saw you on the TV news.

33:08.590 --> 33:09.480
The way you looked

33:09.480 --> 33:10.940
on that competition stage

33:11.350 --> 33:13.240
really resembled your father.

33:17.240 --> 33:18.570
If he were still here,

33:19.880 --> 33:21.640
he would be so proud of you.

33:23.200 --> 33:24.680
So many years have passed.

33:26.160 --> 33:28.960
You're no longer
that little boy from back then.

33:29.830 --> 33:30.550
Uncle Xu,

33:31.750 --> 33:34.410
I've always remembered
what you said back then.

33:35.400 --> 33:36.750
Listen to your uncle.

33:37.350 --> 33:38.350
Don't rush.

33:40.080 --> 33:41.350
You're still young.

33:41.790 --> 33:43.160
You and your mother

33:43.320 --> 33:45.550
have finally adapted to life in America.

33:45.550 --> 33:46.610
At a time like this,

33:46.830 --> 33:48.230
you can't act on impulse.

33:48.750 --> 33:50.370
Your father wouldn't want you
to be reckless either,

33:50.370 --> 33:50.960
right?

33:52.200 --> 33:53.920
So there's nothing I can do?

33:54.230 --> 33:55.920
There's one thing you can do.

33:56.830 --> 33:57.750
Grow up well.

33:59.070 --> 34:00.200
When you're an adult

34:00.680 --> 34:02.680
and have the ability and resources,

34:02.790 --> 34:04.790
only then will you have the chance
to unravel everything

34:04.790 --> 34:06.120
and discover the truth.

34:08.670 --> 34:09.360
Uncle Xu,

34:10.030 --> 34:11.400
I'll grow up quickly.

34:12.550 --> 34:14.080
Sooner or later, I'll prove

34:14.800 --> 34:16.130
my father's innocence.

34:17.400 --> 34:18.150
Good boy.

34:21.510 --> 34:22.360
Zhiyu,

34:22.710 --> 34:23.550
you've grown

34:23.550 --> 34:24.949
so much over these years.

34:25.760 --> 34:27.550
But sometimes I wonder

34:28.230 --> 34:30.000
if what I said back then

34:30.550 --> 34:32.750
planted a seed of revenge in you

34:33.670 --> 34:35.030
that has affected

34:35.840 --> 34:37.760
your life all these years.

34:41.030 --> 34:41.760
Uncle Xu.

34:43.810 --> 34:45.940
I'm one step closer to what I want to do.

34:46.280 --> 34:47.440
I won't give up.

34:48.070 --> 34:48.920
I know.

34:49.440 --> 34:50.620
You've always wanted to clear

34:50.620 --> 34:51.980
your father's name.

34:53.800 --> 34:55.630
But I can't bear to see you

34:56.920 --> 34:58.580
carrying such a heavy burden.

34:59.150 --> 35:01.440
I can't bear to see you risk everything.

35:03.440 --> 35:04.960
You're not young anymore.

35:06.030 --> 35:07.230
As your elder,

35:07.630 --> 35:09.590
I'd rather see you living happily

35:10.250 --> 35:11.730
with a family of your own.

35:13.440 --> 35:17.070
♪ Midnight ♪

35:16.150 --> 35:16.990
Zhiyu,

35:18.080 --> 35:23.140
♪ I see stars fly ♪

35:18.320 --> 35:21.150
it's not easy to turn black into white

35:21.440 --> 35:22.800
all by yourself.

35:24.400 --> 35:26.110
This path is tough.

35:24.970 --> 35:30.320
♪ As they fall to Earth ♪

35:26.480 --> 35:28.000
There may be danger.

35:29.360 --> 35:30.710
No one knows

35:30.920 --> 35:38.320
♪ Lighting up this moment ♪

35:31.960 --> 35:33.220
how this will turn out.

35:35.000 --> 35:36.110
So, Uncle Xu...

35:37.480 --> 35:39.000
given my current situation,

35:39.000 --> 35:41.320
♪ You outshine the stars ♪

35:40.510 --> 35:42.360
I don't have the right
to pursue happiness.

35:41.840 --> 35:44.570
♪ And hold them in your palm ♪

35:45.010 --> 35:48.040
♪ Now we've made a way ♪

35:48.650 --> 35:52.070
♪ Now we're at the edge ♪

35:52.090 --> 35:54.090
♪ Tomorrow and today ♪

35:54.960 --> 35:57.570
♪ Now in every way ♪

35:57.590 --> 36:02.680
♪ The world draws still ♪

36:03.030 --> 36:05.760
Brother, happy New Year.

36:03.170 --> 36:07.570
♪ I wish for you ♪

36:05.760 --> 36:07.510
I want to give you this.

36:08.000 --> 36:08.510
Thank you.

36:08.510 --> 36:10.150
Xinxin, wait for me!

36:09.220 --> 36:14.750
♪ I wish for you ♪

36:15.260 --> 36:21.750
♪ Look up at the moon
and reach for my hand ♪

36:21.770 --> 36:25.560
♪ Oh, I wish for you ♪

36:32.160 --> 36:33.820
Why is your "young boss" here?

36:38.800 --> 36:39.550
Mr. Xiao?

36:39.710 --> 36:42.190
Didn't you say he wouldn't spend
New Year's in the lane?

36:42.190 --> 36:43.710
Yeah, why is he here?

36:46.510 --> 36:47.170
Young boss,

36:47.230 --> 36:48.290
come up and join us.

36:50.750 --> 36:51.390
Mr. Xiao,

36:51.730 --> 36:53.720
that lantern in your hand looks nice.

36:53.720 --> 36:54.980
Could you give it to me?

37:05.880 --> 37:06.510
Mr. Xiao!

37:07.230 --> 37:08.090
Happy New Year.

37:10.000 --> 37:10.800
Happy New Year, Uncle.

37:10.800 --> 37:11.760
Happy New Year.

37:11.760 --> 37:12.440
Let me see.

37:12.820 --> 37:14.550
A child passing by gave it to me.

37:16.320 --> 37:17.230
Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

37:17.230 --> 37:18.840
Why don't you come in for a while?

37:18.840 --> 37:19.500
No, thanks.

37:20.410 --> 37:21.800
You can't leave! You can't leave.

37:21.800 --> 37:22.510
It's New Year's.

37:22.510 --> 37:23.110
Since you're already here,

37:23.110 --> 37:24.030
how can you leave?

37:24.030 --> 37:25.550
Besides, you're Xiu's boss.

37:25.550 --> 37:26.030
Come on, come in.

37:26.030 --> 37:26.880
Come in. Come on.

37:26.880 --> 37:27.440
Come in, come in.

37:27.440 --> 37:28.070
Come in.

37:29.070 --> 37:29.530
Come on.

37:29.550 --> 37:29.960
Mom,

37:29.960 --> 37:30.890
Mr. Xiao is here!

37:31.670 --> 37:32.510
Hello, Auntie.

37:32.510 --> 37:33.000
Come on, have a seat.

37:33.000 --> 37:33.670
Hello.

37:33.670 --> 37:34.360
Happy New Year.

37:34.360 --> 37:35.480
Please have a seat.

37:38.000 --> 37:38.620
Young boss,

37:38.620 --> 37:39.480
it's New Year's.

37:39.480 --> 37:41.150
Why are you all alone?

37:41.330 --> 37:42.660
Where are your parents?

37:43.670 --> 37:44.280
Dad,

37:44.440 --> 37:46.110
Mr. Xiao's family isn't in Shanghai.

37:46.110 --> 37:47.280
He's here by himself.

37:47.280 --> 37:48.960
How can someone spend the New Year alone?

37:48.960 --> 37:50.400
Stay and have dinner with us.

37:50.400 --> 37:51.030
Besides,

37:51.150 --> 37:52.590
you're renting our house,

37:52.590 --> 37:54.230
so we should at least
show you some hospitality,

37:54.230 --> 37:54.920
okay?

37:55.070 --> 37:55.710
Yes, yes.

37:55.710 --> 37:56.840
Stay and have dinner with us.

37:56.840 --> 37:57.920
You chat with my dad here.

37:57.920 --> 37:58.980
I'll go help my mom.

38:01.000 --> 38:02.330
Have some dried fruits.

38:02.420 --> 38:04.360
Dad's attitude toward him
has changed so drastically.

38:04.360 --> 38:04.920
Later,

38:05.280 --> 38:06.410
have a drink with me.

38:08.400 --> 38:09.860
I've got some good baijiu.

38:15.650 --> 38:16.290
It's hot.

38:18.670 --> 38:19.570
Is it good?

38:37.920 --> 38:39.510
Pour for the young boss first.

38:39.510 --> 38:40.230
Don't rush.

38:40.230 --> 38:42.490
Drinking on an empty stomach isn't good.

38:43.110 --> 38:44.770
Let Mr. Xiao eat something first.

38:44.770 --> 38:45.330
Auntie,

38:45.400 --> 38:46.630
you can just call me Yu.

38:46.630 --> 38:47.920
Alright, Yu.

38:48.830 --> 38:49.630
That's enough. That's enough.

38:49.630 --> 38:50.030
Let me fill your glass.

38:50.030 --> 38:50.480
Here,

38:51.070 --> 38:52.400
have some "Fish for Prosperity."

38:52.400 --> 38:54.400
This is your Uncle Hu's specialty.

38:54.400 --> 38:56.150
Try it and see if you like it.

38:58.190 --> 38:59.120
It's delicious.

39:00.400 --> 39:01.510
Actually, this dish

39:01.510 --> 39:03.640
is really suitable for the young boss—

39:03.800 --> 39:04.950
"Rising Higher and Higher."

39:04.950 --> 39:05.620
Next year,

39:05.810 --> 39:07.900
I wish you'd take on more big projects.

39:07.900 --> 39:08.900
Thank you, Uncle.

39:09.230 --> 39:09.750
Here.

39:12.320 --> 39:13.230
In previous years,

39:13.230 --> 39:14.710
it was always just the three of us
celebrating the New Year.

39:14.710 --> 39:15.070
Yes, yes.

39:15.070 --> 39:16.710
This year we have one more person.

39:16.710 --> 39:18.110
It really feels different.

39:18.110 --> 39:19.030
Yes, yes.

39:19.030 --> 39:20.590
We should've had a son-in-law
joining us by now anyway,

39:20.590 --> 39:21.150
right?

39:23.630 --> 39:25.830
I'll go check if the tangyuan are ready.

39:26.670 --> 39:28.550
Why do you always have to
bring up sore subjects?

39:28.550 --> 39:29.670
Didn't you bring it up first?

39:29.670 --> 39:31.000
Is that what I meant?

39:33.440 --> 39:35.230
Here come the tangyuan.

39:35.230 --> 39:35.670
Great!

39:35.670 --> 39:36.430
Help yourselves.

39:36.430 --> 39:37.230
Okay, okay.

39:37.550 --> 39:38.150
Mr. Xiao.

39:39.230 --> 39:41.510
This is our family's special tradition.

39:41.810 --> 39:43.600
We hide one black sugar filling

39:43.800 --> 39:45.190
among the five-nut tangyuan.

39:45.190 --> 39:46.110
Whoever gets it

39:46.110 --> 39:48.040
will have good luck in the new year.

39:48.070 --> 39:48.670
Yes.

39:49.260 --> 39:50.920
Xiu will definitely get it first,

39:50.920 --> 39:51.450
right?

39:51.480 --> 39:54.280
Be sweet and happy,
and then find a good boyfriend.

40:02.920 --> 40:03.760
Young boss,

40:03.780 --> 40:05.530
you're so lucky!

40:06.480 --> 40:08.000
If you ask me,

40:08.550 --> 40:09.550
our old family house

40:09.550 --> 40:10.920
has great feng shui—

40:11.190 --> 40:12.990
it's bringing you good fortune.

40:13.000 --> 40:13.800
It seems

40:13.800 --> 40:15.420
good things will happen to you
this year, Yu.

40:15.420 --> 40:17.810
Maybe next New Year
you won't be alone anymore.

40:17.810 --> 40:20.140
Then I'll gladly accept your good wishes.

40:35.940 --> 40:36.810
Come on, come on!

40:36.810 --> 40:38.340
Come on, let's make a toast.

40:39.000 --> 40:39.400
Alright.

40:39.400 --> 40:40.400
Alright, come on.

40:40.880 --> 40:41.810
Come on, come on.

40:42.190 --> 40:43.320
Cheers!

40:44.110 --> 40:45.230
Wishing everyone good health

40:45.230 --> 40:47.320
and everything going smoothly
in the new year.

40:47.320 --> 40:48.030
Xiu,

40:48.480 --> 40:49.550
let's leave last year where it belongs—

40:49.550 --> 40:50.360
in the past.

40:51.580 --> 40:52.070
It's all in the past.

40:52.070 --> 40:52.710
It's all in the past.

40:52.710 --> 40:53.970
It's all behind us now.

40:54.280 --> 40:54.960
Young boss,

40:55.070 --> 40:56.440
I want to thank you too.

40:56.630 --> 40:57.360
You see, Xiu

40:57.360 --> 40:58.800
now has a stable job,

40:58.800 --> 41:00.390
and her life is back on track.

41:00.390 --> 41:01.300
It's all thanks to you.

41:01.300 --> 41:02.280
Here, I toast to you.

41:02.280 --> 41:02.880
Thank you.

41:02.950 --> 41:03.970
Uncle, you're too kind.

41:03.970 --> 41:04.490
Cheers.

41:05.830 --> 41:07.760
Hu Xiu has actually helped me a lot.

41:09.590 --> 41:10.110
Okay.

41:10.670 --> 41:11.360
Xiu,

41:12.110 --> 41:13.630
well, these past few years,

41:13.630 --> 41:14.280
you've

41:14.280 --> 41:15.880
been through a lot.

41:16.070 --> 41:18.670
From now on,
your days will surely be peaceful,

41:19.110 --> 41:20.190
smooth, and happy.

41:20.470 --> 41:20.980
Okay.

41:25.590 --> 41:26.120
Mr. Xiao.

41:29.710 --> 41:31.030
Uncle is right.

41:33.360 --> 41:33.960
Hu Xiu,

41:34.720 --> 41:35.980
I wish you a New Year...

41:40.290 --> 41:41.410
free from all troubles.
